      "html": "<ul><li><strong>Size:</strong> up to 1 inch (about 2.5 cm)</li><li><strong>Temperament:</strong> Peaceful</li><li><strong>Lifespan:</strong> 2-3 years</li><li><strong>Diet:</strong> Omnivore</li></ul>"
    },
    {
      "key": "beforeYouBuy",
      "source": "bwaquatics",
      "sourceUrl": "https://bwaquatics.com/products/oryzias-woworae-daisy-ricefish",
      "html": "<p>Be sure to have the habitat ready before purchase.</p>"
    },
    {
      "key": "habitat",
      "source": "bwaquatics",
      "sourceUrl": "https://bwaquatics.com/products/oryzias-woworae-daisy-ricefish",
      "html": "<p>Beautiful fish from Sulawesi that is perfect for those looking to add colors to a small aquarium. They have a nice blue metallic shine in the light with a red accent on the body edges.</p>"
    },
    {
      "key": "waterConditions",
      "source": "bwaquatics",
      "sourceUrl": "https://bwaquatics.com/products/oryzias-woworae-daisy-ricefish",
      "html": "<p>Prefers slightly acidic to neutral water (pH 6.0-7.5). However, the seller keeps them in tap water with high TDS and pH. Temperatures between 73-80 °F (about 23-27 °C).</p>"
    },
    {
      "key": "diet",
      "source": "bwaquatics",
      "sourceUrl": "https://bwaquatics.com/products/oryzias-woworae-daisy-ricefish",
      "html": "<p>Omnivore (eats flakes, brine shrimp, bloodworms, and mosquito larvae).</p>"
    },
    {
      "key": "behaviour",
      "source": "bwaquatics",
      "sourceUrl": "https://bwaquatics.com/products/oryzias-woworae-daisy-ricefish",
      "html": "<p>They are schooling fish, so it is recommended to keep them in groups of at least 6 or more. They are also known to jump, so a secure lid is a must for your aquarium.</p>"
    },
    {
      "key": "dimorphism",
      "source": "bwaquatics",
      "sourceUrl": "https://bwaquatics.com/products/oryzias-woworae-daisy-ricefish",
      "html": "<p>Males typically have a translucent bluish body, while females and juveniles are more yellow.</p>"
    }
  ],
